# With list.newItemField focused (keyboard up) on the seeded "Groceries" list, a swipe on the
# item list scrolls the done item ("Buy milk") into view and it is tappable, without closing the
# keyboard (TS-01-01) (covers: REQ-1). Bounds diffing cannot see the keyboard (spike-keyboard-avoid.md),
# so reachability + a successful tap-toggle is the observable signal.
launch
tap text "Groceries"
tap id "list.newItemField"
wait 300
swipe id "list.itemCard" up
expect text "Buy milk"
tap text "Buy milk"
expect count id "item.done" 0
expect count id "item.open" 3
